<section class="about-section">
  <h1>about</h1>
  <p>Lucid Vagary is a home for image-poems and poetry — where creativity inspires insight.</p>
  <p>The site gathers drawings, sketches, photographs, and writing made over many years, presenting them together so each work can be read alongside the others.</p>
  <h2>Finding your way</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/collection/">Collections</a> bring works together through deliberate groupings.</li>
    <li><a href="/constellations/">Constellations</a> trace connections that cross those groupings.</li>
    <li>The <a href="/archive/">archive</a> lists every artwork and piece of writing, with filters by type, subject, and year.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Read more <a href="/about/the-work/">about the work</a>.</p>
</section>
